      "message": "This is a fix needed in order to build successfully with CONFIG_DEBUG_INFO_BTF\u003dy; plan is to send upstream but would welcome any input on if there\u0027s anything I should change first.\n\nWithout the LDFLAGS change, the build tries to use ld instead of lld when building resolve_btfids.\n\nWithout the CFLAGS change, the libbpf dependency and resolve_btfids itself are built using different glibc versions; the newer version used to build libbpf defines fcntl as fcntl64, which is undefined in the older version used to build resolve_btfids.",
